&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class="smt_unitR" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:359.2pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;line-height:9.5pt;font-size:9.5pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:9pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:-9pt;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:14pt;"&gt;２．法定実効税率と税効果会計適用後の法人税等の負担率との差異の原因となった主な項目別の内訳&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_anno1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:25pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;"&gt;  法定実効税率と税効果会計適用後の法人税等の負担率との間の差異が法定実効税率の100分の５以下であるため注記を省略しております。 &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_unitR" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:369pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:10pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:NotesTaxEffectAccountingConsolidatedFinancialStatementsTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:NotesBusinessCombinationsConsolidatedFinancialStatementsTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearDuration">
&lt;h6 class="smt_head4" style="padding-left:18pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;text-align:justify;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;(企業結合等関係)&lt;/h6&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text5" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:33pt;text-indent:0pt;line-height:14pt;"&gt;該当事項はありません。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_unitR" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:369pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10pt;"&gt;　&lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:NotesBusinessCombinationsConsolidatedFinancialStatementsTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:NotesAssetRetirementObligationsConsolidatedFinancialStatementsTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearDuration">
&lt;h6 class="smt_head4" style="padding-left:18pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;text-align:justify;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;(資産除去債務関係)&lt;/h6&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text5" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:33pt;text-indent:0pt;line-height:14pt;"&gt;重要性が乏しいため、記載を省略しております。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_unitR" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:369pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10pt;"&gt;　&lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:NotesAssetRetirementObligationsConsolidatedFinancialStatementsTextBlock>
