&lt;h6 class="smt_head4" style="padding-left:18pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;text-align:justify;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;(賃貸等不動産関係)&lt;/h6&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text5" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:33pt;text-indent:0pt;line-height:14pt;"&gt;賃貸等不動産の総額に重要性が乏しいため、記載を省略しております。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_unitR" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:369pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10pt;"&gt;　&lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:NotesRealEstateForLeaseEtcConsolidatedFinancialStatementsTextBlock>
